msgid "Interpolate"
msgstr "Estemeren"

#. +> trunk
#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:222
msgid "Set this option to interpolate GPS track points which are not closely matched to the GPX data file."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du GPS-Spoorpünkt estemeren wullt, de beter to de Daten ut de GPX-Datei passt."

#. +> trunk
#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:225
msgid "Difference in min.:"
msgstr "Verscheel in Minuten:"

#. +> trunk
#: gpssyncdialog.cpp:227
msgid "Sets the maximum time difference in minutes (240 max.) to interpolate GPX file points to image time data."
msgstr "Leggt den gröttsten Tietverscheel för't Estemeren (toh. 240 Minuten) twischen de GPX-Datenpünkt un de Bilddaten fast."

